  <p>When you click on a product link or coupon on this site and make a purchase, the retailer may pay us a small commission. This is how we fund the research and testing that goes into our reviews and how we keep this site free to use.</p>
  <h2>This does not affect our opinions</h2>
  <p>Our reviews and ratings reflect our genuine assessment of each product. We do not accept payment in exchange for a positive review, and commission potential never determines which products we choose to cover or how we rate them.</p>
  <h2>Pricing and coupon accuracy</h2>
  <p>Prices, availability and coupon codes shown on this site are believed to be accurate as of the publish or last-updated date, but retailers can change them at any time without notice. Always confirm the final price at checkout.</p>
  <p>If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships, feel free to <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.</p>
